    web_fractional_min_width_parsed_whole_px_2026-11-27, P3, fixed, "fractional min-width (87.5px) is parsed to whole px, flex shrink floors 0.5px low", src/lib/gc_async_mut/gpu/browser_engine/simple_web_html_layout_renderer_layout_engine.spl, 0, test/01_unit/browser_engine/fractional_margin_flex_grid_float_chrome159_spec.spl, 2026-11-27, 2026-11-27, true

bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    web_fractional_min_width_parsed_whole_px_2026-11-27, 0, "2026-11-27 found by frac-margin-flex2 lane probes (Chrome 159 headless --force-device-scale-factor=1/4, seed fb80903917d6d5f5, cpu_simd); not fixed there, out of lane scope"
    web_fractional_min_width_parsed_whole_px_2026-11-27, 1, "2026-11-27 w5-5: fixed across style.spl, declarations.spl, layout_foundation.spl, and layout_engine.spl via Style.min_width_milli, multi-phase cascade min_width_milli preservation in apply_authored_style_metadata (reset on explicit min-width/min-inline-size/auto override), logical/physical min-width milli resolution, flex_zero_basis_floor_milli, and milli-px shrink freeze/floor clamping plus box_device_extra_w_record; added AC-28 in fractional_margin_flex_grid_float_chrome159_spec.spl and Bug 2 (cascade + override + min-inline-size 1x/4x) in layout_engine_w5_5_chrome159_fixes_spec.spl. Windows host interpreter: layout_engine_w5_5_chrome159_fixes_spec 5/5 passed; flex_min_width_freeze_chrome159_spec 6/6 passed; min_width_beats_max_width_chrome159_spec 5/5 passed; overflow_hidden_fractional_clip_4x_chrome159_spec 4/4 passed; fractional_margin_flex_grid_float_chrome159_spec 27/28 passed (AC-28 passes; only baseline AC-11 fails without Linux TTF)."
    web_fractional_min_width_parsed_whole_px_2026-11-27, 2, "close_evidence reproducer=test/01_unit/browser_engine/fractional_margin_flex_grid_float_chrome159_spec.spl prevention=test/01_unit/browser_engine/layout_engine_w5_5_chrome159_fixes_spec.spl"

